libmetal: the QNX init code includes its own irq.h.

2026.10 no longer has <metal/irq.h> include the system irq.h, so
metal_qnx_irq_init() and metal_qnx_irq_shutdown() were undeclared in
lib/system/qnx/init.c (an error with -Werror=implicit-function-declaration).

Upstream-Status: QNX-specific (the QNX system layer is carried here)

--- a/lib/system/qnx/init.c
+++ b/lib/system/qnx/init.c
@@ -13,6 +13,7 @@
 #include <metal/sys.h>
 #include <metal/device.h>
 #include <metal/irq.h>
+#include <metal/system/qnx/irq.h>
 #include <metal/cache.h>
 #include <metal/utilities.h>
 
